WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.149
MURDER TWO BUT NOT BE MEDITATED

00:00:03.151 --> 00:00:03.480
MURDER.

00:00:03.481 --> 00:00:04.721
I’M DELIGHTED THAT THE THREE --

00:00:04.722 --> 00:00:06.478
&gt;&gt; Sean: GERALDO, LET ME

00:00:06.513 --> 00:00:08.614
INTERRUPT YOU, IF I MAY

00:00:08.649 --> 00:00:10.594
BRYAN LLENAS IS ONE OF THE LEAD

00:00:10.628 --> 00:00:11.417
POLICE OFFICERS.

00:00:11.452 --> 00:00:12.726
HE’S BEEN THERE WITH THESE

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:14.411
PEOPLE AND THEY HAVE BEEN

00:00:14.445 --> 00:00:15.406
PEACEFUL TONIGHT.

00:00:15.407 --> 00:00:17.690
THEY ARE GETTING ON THEIR KNEES,

00:00:17.691 --> 00:00:18.874
COOPERATING AND GETTING ARRESTED

00:00:18.908 --> 00:00:20.209
AS THIS PERFUME HAS BEEN IN

00:00:20.243 --> 00:00:21.051
EFFECT FOR SOME TIME.

00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:24.323
BUT BRYAN LLENAS IS ON THE SCENE

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:27.646
AND TALKING WITH THE LEAD POLICE

00:00:27.648 --> 00:00:29.362
OFFICERS, BRYAN.

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:32.771
&gt;&gt; SEAN, TALK TO ME ABOUT WHAT

00:00:32.805 --> 00:00:34.102
JUST HAPPENED AND HOW MANY

00:00:34.137 --> 00:00:35.084
PEOPLE WERE ARRESTED AND WHY

00:00:35.085 --> 00:00:35.777
WERE THEY ARRESTED.

00:00:35.778 --> 00:00:39.258
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE BEEN WALKING AROUND

00:00:39.292 --> 00:00:43.094
FOR A LONG TIME, IN THE STREETS,

00:00:43.095 --> 00:00:45.040
AND AT 8:00, THAT IS THE CURFEW.

00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:47.846
THIS IS THE AREA THAT WE’VE HAD

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.908
THEM IN THE LAST TWO NIGHTS.

00:00:49.909 --> 00:00:51.161
EVERYBODY KNOWS WHAT HAPPENS

00:00:51.162 --> 00:00:51.680
HERE.

00:00:51.682 --> 00:00:53.285
WE GAVE THEM WARNINGS.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:54.832
CURFEW WAS IN EFFECT.

00:00:54.866 --> 00:00:55.877
CURFEW WAS IN EFFECT.

00:00:55.911 --> 00:00:58.499
NO ONE WANTED TO LEAVE SO WE

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.919
BROUGHT OUR TEAMS AND I MADE 60

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:03.220
ARRESTS AND ABLE TO DISPERSE THE

00:01:03.254 --> 00:01:05.310
REST OF THE CROWD.

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:07.842
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU TALK TO ME A LITTLE

00:01:07.844 --> 00:01:11.303
BIT ABOUT WHAT IS IT THAT YOU

00:01:11.305 --> 00:01:12.697
GUYS HAVE BEEN FACING FROM

00:01:12.732 --> 00:01:13.675
LOOTERS?

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.861
&gt;&gt; FROM DAY ONE, THURSDAY NIGHT,

00:01:16.862 --> 00:01:18.812
ROCKS, BOTTLES, BRICKS, WE’VE

00:01:18.846 --> 00:01:21.281
BEEN SHOT AT, RUN OVER BY CARS,

00:01:21.316 --> 00:01:23.917
BUT THEY ARE STILL OUT THERE AS

00:01:23.919 --> 00:01:26.425
YOU CAN SEE IN FORCE KEEPING THE

00:01:26.426 --> 00:01:27.986
CITY SAFE AND BEING EXTREMELY

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:30.223
EFFECTIVE, DOING THE JOB TO MAKE

00:01:30.257 --> 00:01:32.359
SURE THIS CITY IS OUR CITY.

00:01:32.393 --> 00:01:33.687
WE ARE ONE WITH THE PROTESTERS.

00:01:33.721 --> 00:01:35.794
WE ARE OUT THERE FOR A JUSTIFIED

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.319
CAUSE, BUT NOT FOR THE PEOPLE

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.185
THAT WANT TO CAUSE MAYHEM FOR

00:01:40.219 --> 00:01:40.797
THE CITY.

00:01:40.798 --> 00:01:43.889
&gt;&gt; THE NYPD HASN’T DONE ITS JOB

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:45.594
AND HASN’T DONE ENOUGH.

00:01:45.596 --> 00:01:47.018
CAN YOU TELL ME WHAT YOUR

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:48.000
RESPONSES TO THAT.

00:01:48.035 --> 00:01:49.662
&gt;&gt; I DON’T WANT TO GO BACK AND

00:01:49.696 --> 00:01:50.615
FORTH WITH THE GOVERNOR.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:52.259
THE GOVERNOR IS THE GOVERNOR.

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:54.561
FOR ALL I KNOW THERE ARE MEN AND

00:01:54.596 --> 00:01:56.187
WOMEN EVERY DAY AS YOU SAW HERE,

00:01:56.188 --> 00:01:58.346
WE ARE MOVING TACTICALLY AND WE

00:01:58.347 --> 00:01:59.567
TAKE PEOPLE OUT.

00:01:59.568 --> 00:02:01.582
WE ALLOW PEOPLE TO PROTEST, BUT

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.322
IF THEY START VIOLATING THE LAW,

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:05.566
WE ARE GOING TO TAKE ACTION.

00:02:05.599 --> 00:02:08.416
AND WE ARE GOING TO MAKE SURE WE

00:02:08.417 --> 00:02:08.996
HAVE THE CITY UNDER CONTROL.

